  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "施工法",
    "sub_ename": "CONSTRUCTION  METHODS",
    "describe_ch": "土木工程包括如鐵路、公路、隧道、橋梁、建築……等工程，而要完成一個優良的工程，除施工前應有完善設計外，其中工程材料、施工步驟與注意事項之掌控都是重要的關鍵。本課程將介紹鋼筋混凝土、鋼構及模板等基礎工程項目，並導入各種工程之應用，進而讓學生畢業後於職場中能配合工程需要靈活應用。",
    "describe_eh": "Civil engineering includes projects such as railways, highways, tunnels, bridges,\nbuildings, etc. To complete a good project, in addition to a perfect design before\nconstruction, the control of engineering materials, construction steps and precautions is important. This course will introduce basic engineering projects such as reinforced concrete, steel structure and formwork, and introduce various engineering applications,\nso that students can flexible use to meet engineering needs in the workplace after graduation.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
